Project 1 - Syringe Pump

Scope and Motivation

Line sterilization/flush requires an operator to manually inject large volume of SWFI into thin tubing. This is a time consuming process that takes effort, energy, and if done incorrectly can negatively impact the efficacy of the final drug product. Therefore, it is the scope of this project to assemble a syringe pump which will actuate the plunger via regulated air pressure in a safe and controlled manner to flush the lines with minimal operator interference. 


Skills Used

3D Modeling with Solidworks

